{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01708","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长安少年行十首 五 · 李廓","name":"杂曲歌辞 长安少年行十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遨游携艳妓，装束似男儿。\n杯酒逢花住，笙歌簇马吹。\n鸎声催曲急，春色讶归迟。\n不以闻衔鼓，华筵待月移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}